                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5a8e8bc-bd27-4900-afc8-a6371092d8a0",
                                "sense_id": "c82958c6-5749-37a6-9700-751aed1dc8c2",
                                "text": "— Ну, не отревелся еще, рёва! — сказал Кузьмичов. — Опять, баловник, слюни распустил! Не хочешь ехать, так оставайся. Никто силой не тянет!",
                                "translation": "\"Come, not done howling yet, cry-baby!\" cried Kuzmitchov. \"You are blubbering again, little milksop! If you don't want to go, stay behind; no one is taking you by force!",
                                "english": "\"Come, not done howling yet, cry-baby!\" cried Kuzmitchov. \"You are blubbering again, little milksop! If you don't want to go, stay behind; no one is taking you by force!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
